name: Saved decisions retain exact observed-source receipts without claiming current-source review
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/decision_receipts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | observed-source-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 AWS Access Key | observed-source-detail
submit: decision fp Owned public documentation example is intentional
require-live-snap: 25 recorded observation revision-base-003 | source-bound-save
expect-not: will carry forward
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/decision_receipts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART advance
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/decision_receipts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART cli
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | externally-recorded-decisions
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Owned receipt needs current-source review | recorded-source-review
expect: revision-later
expect: No later observation
resize: 160x48
live-snap: source-receipt-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: source-receipt-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: source-receipt-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: source-receipt-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: source-receipt-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: source-receipt-40x12-detail
keys: NPage
live-snap: source-receipt-40x12-next
keys: NPage
live-snap: source-receipt-40x12-source
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Decision commit | source-receipt-40x12-commit
expect: revision-later
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 SOURCE | source-receipt-40x12-excerpt
ask: Does a saved decision name the observed source, preserve its historical basis on a dirty checkout, and avoid implying current-code assessment or automatic reuse?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/decision_receipts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | recovered-source-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned receipt needs current-source review | recovered-source-detail
expect: revision-later
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/decision_receipts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart retain four observations, three explicit human decisions and the original source references, with no provider work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
